00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.520
I’ve been dying to know!

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:05.920
Anika.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:06.720
Yeah?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.440
My father.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.840
He’s in a coma.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.520
I’m so sorry.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.320
Hey, girl.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.120
Wait.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:17.880
What?

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.200
Girl.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.120
When was the last time

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.240
you had your period?
